notes: Story is stored with the page. A prompt disappears when the chat ends; this doesn't. It records what the page is for, what must not change, and what this edit is meant to do. When another agent — or another person — opens the page, they start from the intent, not from a guess. It's an alignment tool, not a guarantee. The model can still get it wrong; but at least it's wrong against something explicit.
